        Swipe through the boxes people order most. Each one is already priced
        below buying the same products on their own.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="purelane-bundles__grid">

      <!-- Kitchen essentials -->
      <article class="purelane-bundle">
        <div class="purelane-bundle__top">
          <span class="purelane-bundle__saving">You save ₹398</span>
          <span class="purelane-bundle__tag">Most popular</span>
        </div>

        <div class="purelane-bundle__products">
          <span>Foaming Kitchen Cleaner</span>
          <b>+</b>
          <span>Dishwash Gel</span>
          <b>+</b>
          <span>Tap Cleaner</span>
        </div>

