          <span class="purelane-bundle__count">3 products</span>

          <p>
            Includes: Foaming Kitchen Cleaner, Dishwash Gel & Tap Cleaner.
            Everything for a sparkling kitchen, no need to pick separately.
          </p>

          <div class="purelane-bundle__price">
            <strong>₹499</strong>
            <s>₹897</s>
            <em>Save ₹398</em>
          </div>

          <small>Inclusive of all taxes · COD available</small>

          <a href="/collections/all" class="purelane-bundle__button">
            Shop bundle →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>


